#!/bin/sh
# NeuralDeep data for the bar widget: wallet balance, limits, and model
# pricing, normalized into one JSON object. Always exits 0 and prints JSON;
# failures come back as {"ok":false,"error":"..."} so the widget renders a
# message instead of a broken popup.
#
# Key resolution, in order:
#   1. $NEURALDEEP_API_KEY
#   2. first line of ~/.config/neuraldeep/api-key (or $NEURALDEEP_KEY_FILE)
#   3. providers.neuraldeep.settings.apiKey in the opencode config
# Base URL: $NEURALDEEP_BASE_URL, else the public endpoint.
#
# The key is fed to curl on stdin (`-H @-`) so it never shows up in `ps`.
# shortcut: reads the opencode config layout directly; revisit if opencode
# moves provider credentials out of opencode.json.
set -eu

base=${NEURALDEEP_BASE_URL:-https://api.neuraldeep.ru/v1}
key=${NEURALDEEP_API_KEY:-}

if [ -z "$key" ]; then
  key_file=${NEURALDEEP_KEY_FILE:-${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/neuraldeep/api-key}
  if [ -r "$key_file" ]; then
    key=$(head -n 1 "$key_file" | tr -d '[:space:]')
  fi
fi

if [ -z "$key" ]; then
  cfg=${NEURALDEEP_OPENCODE_CONFIG:-$HOME/.config/opencode/opencode.json}
  if [ -r "$cfg" ]; then
    key=$(jq -r '.providers.neuraldeep.settings.apiKey // empty' "$cfg" 2>/dev/null || true)
  fi
fi

if [ -z "$key" ]; then
  printf '%s' '{"ok":false,"error":"no-key"}'
  exit 0
fi

limits=$(printf 'Authorization: Bearer %s\n' "$key" | curl -fsS --max-time 10 --max-filesize 262144 \
  -H @- "$base/limits" 2>/dev/null) || limits=
if [ -z "$limits" ]; then
  printf '%s' '{"ok":false,"error":"unreachable"}'
  exit 0
fi

models=$(printf 'Authorization: Bearer %s\n' "$key" | curl -fsS --max-time 15 --max-filesize 4194304 \
  -H @- "$base/models" 2>/dev/null) || models='{"data":[]}'

printf '%s' "$limits" | jq -c --argjson models "$models" '
  def num: if type == "number" then . else null end;
  def meter: if type == "object" then {
      used: (.used | num),
      limit: (.limit | num),
      remaining: (.remaining | num),
      resetsAt: (.resets_at // null)
    } else null end;
  {
    ok: true,
    observedAt: (.observed_at // null),
    tier: (.tier // null),
    key: {
      name: (.key.name // null),
      status: (.key.status // null),
      billingMode: (.key.billing_mode // null)
    },
    wallet: (if (.wallet | type) == "object" then {
      balance: (.wallet.balance_rub | num),
      spent30d: (.wallet.spent_rub_30d | num)
    } else null end),
    daily: (if (.daily_capacity | type) == "object" then {
      pct: (.daily_capacity.pct_used | num),
      exhausted: (.daily_capacity.exhausted // false),
      resetsAt: (.daily_capacity.resets_at // null)
    } else null end),
    chat: {
      session: (.chat.session | meter),
      week: (.chat.week | meter)
    },
    parallelLimit: (.parallel_limit | num),
    night: (if (.night | type) == "object" then {
      enabled: (.night.enabled // false),
      active: (.night.active // false)
    } else null end),
    models: ((($models.data) // [])
      | map(select(.type == "chat"))
      | map({
          id: (.id | tostring),
          context: (.limit.context | num),
          input: (.pricing.input_per_1m | num),
          output: (.pricing.output_per_1m | num)
        })
      | sort_by([.input == null, .input]))
  }
' 2>/dev/null || printf '%s' '{"ok":false,"error":"parse"}'
